Z||000001||86seyellow||09-01-2001||09:46 PM||||Ok, <P>I am a MFF member, havent been able to go to any shows or meetings due to prior committments. The new engine is goign to be here this week so I cant do fieroama. I am in the cities alot and woudl really like to meet everyone. Why dont we set something up in advance so I can do this. It takes me about 2 hours to get there. I have talked to MinnGreen about where I live. Minn Green when you do fieroama on yoru way to Winona youll pass my house on HWy 61 just south of Wabasha. If any of the minnestoa guys want to talk give me a call.<P>ROn 651-565-2757<P>------------------<BR>if you saw a yellow streak go by you really fast it was a fiero<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieropix1.JPG"> ||||reg||9
