Z||000003||Standard||09-02-2001||02:18 AM||||It was pretty cool, met up with Jaei Sun, LowfieroGT and Jimmy at arby's.  Was cruising around for a bit before that.. best comment of the night:<P>Pulling into Porky's.. "Look!  A Fiero!"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>At least they know what it is...<P>Headed out to red rock with Jason after that, got to stay there for about 15 minutes till the cops came down and the place cleared out.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Jimmy||09-02-2001||03:27 AM||||Hey guys, glad I met up with you for awhile.  It's too bad you guys didn't get down to Red Rock earlier to see us race.  I got three good races in, and then when I lined up for another, I heard there was a cop sitting back about three blocks.  I got out of there and there he was sitting in a parking lot just waiting for people.  I just drove right by.  I guess cops show up at around 12:00, I will be there tomorow.<P>BTW if you go there again the first parking lot on the left off of 61 is for american cars, the strip mall(farther down) is for ricers or imports.  This is just how people park, its not necessarily the way it has to be.  Then of course you drive down the road to find the drag strip(deserted road).  I guess the employees that are working at the warehouses love it when people are racing, they come out and watch on their break, they just don't want to see any garbage left behind.<P>Jim<p>[This message has been edited by Jimmy (edited 09-02-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||Standard||09-02-2001||08:32 PM||||I think I'm gonna be heading up there again tonight, too.  Should be leaving in a half-hour or as soon as I get my car back together.  We'll see how long big zip-ties last holding a CV boot on..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000006||Jimmy||09-03-2001||03:34 AM||||Ahh!!! Another fun night.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Another night cut short by the MAN again(no offense fierohoho).  Good to see Standard, Jaei Sun, and Dslice? down at red rock.  My alternator is officialy toast, died on me on the way home.  Time to break down and get one of those 100 amp deals. Guys I want to try and go to Fierorama this weekend, so far I know Standard, Minngreengt, KEV, and some other MFF members are going, anyone else?<P>Jaei Sun, if I can't make Fierorama I will try and make it to Rock Falls Sunday to get some ETs.  LMK if your interested in going.<P>Jim||||reg||1
Z||000007||fierohoho||09-03-2001||03:39 AM||||None taken <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Wish I could go with, but, I'm on my 4 month rotation of nights. Thursday through sunday 8:00pm to 6:00am.<P>If anyone gets bored on weekends before the snow flies cruise up to Mora and look me up, it'd be nice to see some Fieros other than mine.<P>Have fun! HOHO<P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pennockpic.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000008||MinnGreenGT||09-03-2001||11:53 PM||||Hey guys... sorry I missed you at Porkey's.  I was up there Friday night for a couple of hours.  Few nice rides, but nothing spectacular- saw Jimmy's brother.  Jimmy- how was Vegas?  Hope to see a bunch of you at  FieroRama!<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg"> <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
